sudo insmod *.ko -> add a .ko to kernel
sudo modprobe -> add a .ko and dependencies
-> Check lib/modules/$(uname -r)/modules.dep

There are serveral seperate modules which are not needed to be embedded into initramfs.img:
	Ex: gpio-omap.ko -> initramfs.img (needed to mount rootfilesystem)
	    spi-gpio.ko X-> initramfs.img (not needed to mount rootfilesystem)
But if -> initramfs manually: add the name of .ko to ../etc/initramfs-tools/modules

